          "quote": "它主要筛查的是宫颈病变，不能排除子宫内膜的问题"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00151",
          "explanation": "Doctor requests family teach-back by saying '不要以宫颈阴性拖延内膜病变处理' in a plain-language, non-shaming way that lowers resistance.",
          "quote": "先尽快约你妈妈本人一周内能看的妇科/妇瘤门诊"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor not only corrected the misunderstanding but provided a teachable, non-shaming, anatomically clear explanation and structured the next steps so the family could repeat it back. This goes beyond generic advice and is integrated into the closure plan.",
