      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor clarifies family role and current state, asks for age/menopause/symptoms, and distinguishes online advice from in-person evaluation.",
          "quote": "你妈妈的年龄、是否绝经、有没有高血压/糖尿病/肥胖，以及现在还有没有异常出血"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly asked about the patient's age, menopausal status, and current bleeding, and repeatedly framed online advice as not replacing in-person assessment.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1_context_and_current_state",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00068",
          "explanation": "Doctor directs the family to obtain the original pathology report and lists specific keywords to check.",
          "quote": "先把几件最关键的事问清：病理大概怎么理解、需不需要复核、切片蜡块怎么交"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor acknowledges that the current report could be EIN or contain malignant terms and requires expert interpretation.",
          "quote": "病理报告原文到底写什么：是“子宫内膜非典型增生”，还是“子宫内膜上皮内瘤变/EIN”"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly emphasized that the original pathology report is the decision-making core, listed the specific terms to look for, and used workspace data to guide the next steps.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_pathology_and_record_verification",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
