          "quote": "它主要筛查的是宫颈病变，不能排除子宫内膜的问题"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor clearly differentiated the anatomical sites and screening purposes, and used the pathology as the primary decision-making basis without blaming the family.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_correct_cervical_screening_misinterpretation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
